Package: hyperuuid
Type: Package
Title: RFC 9562 UUIDs: Versions 4, 5 and 7 and a 'SQL Server' Ordering
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Brian", "Buvinghausen", email = "buvinghausen@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Skunk Werkx", role = "cph"),
    person("Authors of the vendored Rust crates", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "see inst/AUTHORS")
  )
Description: Generates RFC 9562 version 4 (random), version 5 (name-based) and
    version 7 (time-ordered) UUIDs, inspects their version, variant and timestamp,
    and converts version 7 values to and from a version 8 layout that sorts by
    creation time in 'SQL Server' indexes. The work is done by a compiled 'Rust'
    core shared with the project's bindings for other languages. Every function
    is vectorised: character, integer, logical and POSIXct results propagate NA
    element-wise, while the raw conversions and every argument are strict and
    error.
